'''PZ Loot Containers''' is a dataset of the [[Procedural distributions]] associated to categories to more easily identify the different distributions of the game. It is used by [[KR Core OS]] to provide a tool for modders to add items to specific categories of distributions.

== See also ==
* [[PZ Data]]
* [[KR Core OS]]

